<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,A,C,x,s\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,A,C,x,s\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span>（拓扑空间谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\\)</span>（闭包谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-序列谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d490b03448142d4c\" href=\"?note=d490b03448142d4c\" title=\"58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence\">58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S\\)</span>（序列收敛谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"91dfddd12189e300\" href=\"?note=91dfddd12189e300\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9FrechetUrysohnSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9FrechetUrysohnSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（本原子定义的谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}frechet\\text{-}urysohn\\text{-}space}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9FrechetUrysohnSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\forall C\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,A,C)\\to\\forall x\\in C\\;\\exists s\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(s,A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S(s,x,X,\\tau)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}frechet\\text{-}urysohn\\text{-}space}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9FrechetUrysohnSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\forall C\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,A,C)\\to\\forall x\\in C\\;\\exists s\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(s,A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S(s,x,X,\\tau)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fréchet–Urysohn 性要求每个闭包点都是原集合中某个序列的极限。</li>\n<li>“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\omega\\to A\">\\(s:\\omega\\to A\\)</span>”与“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\to x\">\\(s\\to x\\)</span>”均由规范谓词展开，避免把类型标注当成已验证公式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"91dfddd12189e300","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","hea